                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "An interesting mix of Might and Magic and Heroes of Might and Magic, with a healthy chunk of procedural generation to keep things different. A good combination of dungeon crawling and resource management, with enough depth and variety to make some short- and medium-term planning useful. Not a roguelite, expect campaigns to take a good amount of time and build enough investment that you don't want to just risk everything. Graphics are decent  and functional but nothing stunning, music is appropriate but a little repetitive. Scratches a unique dungeon-crawling itch.",
